ta-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/AppVueTable.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"AppVueTable"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TTableComponents"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TCellComponents"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"THeaderComponents"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"interface-createtablehookresulttfeatures-ttablecomponents-tcellcomponents-theadercomponents","text":"Interface: CreateTableHookResult<TFeatures, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"ttablecomponents","text":"TTableComponents","level":3},{"id":"tcellcomponents","text":"TCellComponents","level":3},{"id":"theadercomponents","text":"THeaderComponents","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"appfeatures","text":"appFeatures","level":3},{"id":"createappcolumnhelper","text":"createAppColumnHelper()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"useapptable","text":"useAppTable()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-3","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tdata-2","text":"TData","level":5},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tableoptions","text":"tableOptions","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"usecellcontext","text":"useCellContext()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-4","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":5},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"useheadercontext","text":"useHeaderContext()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-5","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tvalue-2","text":"TValue","level":5},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"usetablecontext","text":"useTableContext()","level":3},{"id":"type-parameters-6","text":"Type Parameters","level":4},{"id":"tdata-3","text":"TData","level":5},{"id":"returns-5","text":"Returns","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Interface: CreateTableHookResult\\<TFeatures, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:226](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L226)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TTableComponents\n\n`TTableComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`ComponentType`](../type-aliases/ComponentType.md)\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n### TCellComponents\n\n`TCellComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`ComponentType`](../type-aliases/ComponentType.md)\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n### THeaderComponents\n\n`THeaderComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`ComponentType`](../type-aliases/ComponentType.md)\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### appFeatures\n\n```ts\nappFeatures: TFeatures;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:233](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L233)\n\nThe features object that was passed to `createTableHook`.\n\n***\n\n### createAppColumnHelper()\n\n```ts\ncreateAppColumnHelper: <TData>() => AppColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:238](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L238)\n\nA column helper pre-bound to `TFeatures` and the registered components, so\nthe cell/header/footer render props expose the bound components.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`AppColumnHelper`](../type-aliases/AppColumnHelper.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TCellComponents`, `THeaderComponents`\\>\n\n***\n\n### useAppTable()\n\n```ts\nuseAppTable: <TData>(tableOptions) => AppVueTable<TFeatures, TData, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:248](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L248)\n\nCreates a table with the `App*` wrapper components and registered\n`tableComponents` attached. `TData` is inferred from the `data` option.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### tableOptions\n\n`Omit`\\<[`TableOptionsWithReactiveData`](../type-aliases/TableOptionsWithReactiveData.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>, `\"features\"`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`AppVueTable`](../type-aliases/AppVueTable.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TTableComponents`, `TCellComponents`, `THeaderComponents`\\>\n\n***\n\n### useCellContext()\n\n```ts\nuseCellContext: <TValue>() => Cell_Core<TFeatures, any, TValue> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, Cell_FeatureMap> & TCellComponents & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:276](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L276)\n\nReads the cell provided by the nearest `<table.AppCell>`, extended with your\n`cellComponents` and a context-bound `FlexRender`.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `unknown` = `unknown`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Cell_Core`\\<`TFeatures`, `any`, `TValue`\\> & `ExtractFeatureMapTypes`\\<`TFeatures`, `Cell_FeatureMap`\\> & `TCellComponents` & `object`\n\n***\n\n### useHeaderContext()\n\n```ts\nuseHeaderContext: <TValue>() => Header_Core<TFeatures, any, TValue> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, Header_FeatureMap> & THeaderComponents & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:287](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L287)\n\nReads the header provided by the nearest `<table.AppHeader>` /\n`<table.AppFooter>`, extended with your `headerComponents` and a\ncontext-bound `FlexRender`.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `unknown` = `unknown`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Header_Core`\\<`TFeatures`, `any`, `TValue`\\> & `ExtractFeatureMapTypes`\\<`TFeatures`, `Header_FeatureMap`\\> & `THeaderComponents` & `object`\n\n***\n\n### useTableContext()\n\n```ts\nuseTableContext: <TData>() => AppVueTable<TFeatures, TData, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:265](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L265)\n\nReads the table provided by the nearest `<table.AppTable>`. This is the same\nextended instance `useAppTable` returns, so the `App*` components and your\n`tableComponents` are available on it.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData` = `RowData`\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`AppVueTable`](../type-aliases/AppVueTable.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TTableComponents`, `TCellComponents`, `THeaderComponents`\\>\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CreateTableHookResult\ntitle: CreateTableHookResult\n---\n\n# Interface: CreateTableHookResult\\<TFeatures, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents\\>\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:226](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L226)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* `TableFeatures`\n\n### TTableComponents\n\n`TTableComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`ComponentType`](../type-aliases/ComponentType.md)\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n### TCellComponents\n\n`TCellComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`ComponentType`](../type-aliases/ComponentType.md)\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n### THeaderComponents\n\n`THeaderComponents` *extends* `Record`\\<`string`, [`ComponentType`](../type-aliases/ComponentType.md)\\<`any`\\>\\>\n\n## Properties\n\n### appFeatures\n\n```ts\nappFeatures: TFeatures;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:233](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L233)\n\nThe features object that was passed to `createTableHook`.\n\n***\n\n### createAppColumnHelper()\n\n```ts\ncreateAppColumnHelper: <TData>() => AppColumnHelper<TFeatures, TData, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:238](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L238)\n\nA column helper pre-bound to `TFeatures` and the registered components, so\nthe cell/header/footer render props expose the bound components.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`AppColumnHelper`](../type-aliases/AppColumnHelper.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TCellComponents`, `THeaderComponents`\\>\n\n***\n\n### useAppTable()\n\n```ts\nuseAppTable: <TData>(tableOptions) => AppVueTable<TFeatures, TData, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:248](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L248)\n\nCreates a table with the `App*` wrapper components and registered\n`tableComponents` attached. `TData` is inferred from the `data` option.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData`\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### tableOptions\n\n`Omit`\\<[`TableOptionsWithReactiveData`](../type-aliases/TableOptionsWithReactiveData.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`\\>, `\"features\"`\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`AppVueTable`](../type-aliases/AppVueTable.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TTableComponents`, `TCellComponents`, `THeaderComponents`\\>\n\n***\n\n### useCellContext()\n\n```ts\nuseCellContext: <TValue>() => Cell_Core<TFeatures, any, TValue> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, Cell_FeatureMap> & TCellComponents & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:276](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L276)\n\nReads the cell provided by the nearest `<table.AppCell>`, extended with your\n`cellComponents` and a context-bound `FlexRender`.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `unknown` = `unknown`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Cell_Core`\\<`TFeatures`, `any`, `TValue`\\> & `ExtractFeatureMapTypes`\\<`TFeatures`, `Cell_FeatureMap`\\> & `TCellComponents` & `object`\n\n***\n\n### useHeaderContext()\n\n```ts\nuseHeaderContext: <TValue>() => Header_Core<TFeatures, any, TValue> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, Header_FeatureMap> & THeaderComponents & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:287](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L287)\n\nReads the header provided by the nearest `<table.AppHeader>` /\n`<table.AppFooter>`, extended with your `headerComponents` and a\ncontext-bound `FlexRender`.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TValue\n\n`TValue` *extends* `unknown` = `unknown`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`Header_Core`\\<`TFeatures`, `any`, `TValue`\\> & `ExtractFeatureMapTypes`\\<`TFeatures`, `Header_FeatureMap`\\> & `THeaderComponents` & `object`\n\n***\n\n### useTableContext()\n\n```ts\nuseTableContext: <TData>() => AppVueTable<TFeatures, TData, TTableComponents, TCellComponents, THeaderComponents>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts:265](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/vue-table/src/createTableHook.ts#L265)\n\nReads the table provided by the nearest `<table.AppTable>`. This is the same\nextended instance `useAppTable` returns, so the `App*` components and your\n`tableComponents` are available on it.\n\n#### Type Parameters\n\n##### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* `RowData` = `RowData`\n\n#### Returns\n\n[`AppVueTable`](../type-aliases/AppVueTable.md)\\<`TFeatures`, `TData`, `TTableComponents`, `TCellComponents`, `THeaderComponents`\\>\n"}
